* Generic zero count on the square of half-side ` 13 / 8 ` about ` 2 + i T ` : for ` F ` holomorphic on the right half-plane, bounded by ` B ` on ` [ 1 / 4 , 15 / 4 ] x. [ T - 3 , T + 3 ] ` and with ` M <_ abs F ( 2 + i t ) ` for ` t e. [ T - 2 , T + 2 ] ` , the zeros are finitely many, of order in ` NN ` , with mass at most ` 4 log ( B / M ) / log ( 25 / 24 ) ` : four strips of height ` 13 / 16 ` ( ~ jenstrip , ~ fsumunle ; C10's ~ lchrzc for a generic ` F ` ).

